{"id":"cul-xixia-wenzi","cat":"culture","type":"文字","name":"西夏文","era":"西夏","year":1036,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"元昊命野利仁荣仿汉字创制西夏文，用于官方文书、佛经与碑刻。","tags":["西夏文","野利仁荣","黑水城"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"西夏文创于 1036 年前后，字形仿汉字而笔画繁复，共六千余字。西夏以之译佛经、编字典《文海》，黑水城出土的西夏文文献是研究党项文化与语言的主要材料。","body":null,"refs":"《宋史·夏国传》《文海》","categoryName":"文化","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"cul-liao-wenzi","name":"契丹大字与小字","cat":"culture"},{"id":"cul-xixia-fojiao","name":"西夏佛教","cat":"culture"},{"id":"emp-xixia-jingzong","name":"夏景宗 李元昊","cat":"people"},{"id":"geo-heishuicheng","name":"黑水城","cat":"geography"},{"id":"lit-fanhan","name":"《番汉合时掌中珠》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"ppl-yelirenrong","name":"野利仁荣","cat":"people"},{"id":"tec-xixia-lifa","name":"西夏历法与历书","cat":"tech"},{"id":"tho-xixia-ruxue","name":"西夏儒学与番汉之学","cat":"thought"}],"sources":[]}